            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Foo is a game that aims to help learners learn how to build and apply mental models consistently, a skill found to be strongly correlated with success in early learning of programming. Foo will provides a series of activities in which learners have to experiment with objects that behave in unusual ways, construct a mental model about how these objects work, and apply the mental model to\r\nsolve problems.",
